OL,3,GNEWSAConservationist honoured for
OL,4,Aprotecting rare animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA conservationist who set up a wildlife
OL,7,Fconservation charity has said being
OL,8,Fgiven an honorary degree is the
OL,9,F"highlight" of his year.
OL,11,FTullis Matson, who stores biological
OL,12,Fsamples in a 'time capsule' to help
OL,13,Fprotect endangered species from going
OL,14,Fextinct, said he was particularly
OL,15,Fthrilled with the award marking his
OL,16,Fachievements as he is "very dyslexic"
OL,17,Fand "left school with no
OL,18,Fqualifications".
