OL,3,GNEWSAConservationist honoured for
OL,4,Aprotecting rare animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is among a cohort of seven people to
OL,7,Fbe given the award by Shropshire's
OL,8,FHarper Adams University as part of its
OL,9,F125th anniversary celebrations.
OL,11,FComedian Ed Byrne and The Archers
OL,12,Factress Felicity Finch are part of the
OL,13,Fgroup receiving their degrees this
OL,14,Fmonth.
